        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bowlers is THE bowling simulation. Create your character, experience their adventure, and progress from amateur matches to professional tournaments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in a free game, manage your bag of balls, prove yourself in career mode, become the best player in the world in ranked or online tournaments, and test your skills in the lab—everything is possible in Bowlers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover all the different bowling alleys available in the game, each with its own type, lanes, and favorite surfaces, from wooden bowling alleys to the latest synthetic bowling alleys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your characters to your liking. Not to mention realistic ball management, where you can modify the drilling, surface, slugs, inserts, and many other customization features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the basics of bowling, including oil patterns, lane transition, game lines, and everything else there is to know about this sport! Or just have fun with friends, it's your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681580/extras/1866f2e885e6902bd3eeb6acc3ccea9b.poster.avif?t=1788699429\" width=1170 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681580/extras/1866f2e885e6902bd3eeb6acc3ccea9b.webm?t=1788699429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681580/extras/1866f2e885e6902bd3eeb6acc3ccea9b.mp4?t=1788699429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build the ultimate arsenal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681580/extras/fb8b0f9744457b1ec0c2900073aab8f4.webp?t=1788699429\" width=202 height=12 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bowlers, you have to build an entire bag from a selection of more than 100 bowling balls to battle and conquer a large variety of lane conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your balls unique, change their drilling, surface, slugs and insert colors, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While discovering all those different reactions, adjust yourself to multiple different oil patterns and different bowling centers with unique properties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681580/extras/6d7752d0b1816167e72ae851941fc5f8.poster.avif?t=1788699429\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681580/extras/6d7752d0b1816167e72ae851941fc5f8.webm?t=1788699429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681580/extras/6d7752d0b1816167e72ae851941fc5f8.mp4?t=1788699429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a bowler, you're a bowler, we're BOWLERS!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bowlers is THE bowling simulation. Create your character, experience their adventure, and progress from amateur matches to professional tournaments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in a free game, manage your bag of balls, prove yourself in career mode, become the best player in the world in ranked or online tournaments, and test your skills in the lab—everything is possible in Bowlers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover all the different bowling alleys available in the game, each with its own type, lanes, and favorite surfaces, from wooden bowling alleys to the latest synthetic bowling alleys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your characters to your liking. Not to mention realistic ball management, where you can modify the drilling, surface, slugs, inserts, and many other customization features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the basics of bowling, including oil patterns, lane transition, game lines, and everything else there is to know about this sport! Or just have fun with friends, it's your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681580/extras/1866f2e885e6902bd3eeb6acc3ccea9b.poster.avif?t=1788699429\" width=1170 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681580/extras/1866f2e885e6902bd3eeb6acc3ccea9b.webm?t=1788699429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681580/extras/1866f2e885e6902bd3eeb6acc3ccea9b.mp4?t=1788699429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build the ultimate arsenal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681580/extras/fb8b0f9744457b1ec0c2900073aab8f4.webp?t=1788699429\" width=202 height=12 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bowlers, you have to build an entire bag from a selection of more than 100 bowling balls to battle and conquer a large variety of lane conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your balls unique, change their drilling, surface, slugs and insert colors, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While discovering all those different reactions, adjust yourself to multiple different oil patterns and different bowling centers with unique properties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681580/extras/6d7752d0b1816167e72ae851941fc5f8.poster.avif?t=1788699429\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681580/extras/6d7752d0b1816167e72ae851941fc5f8.webm?t=1788699429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681580/extras/6d7752d0b1816167e72ae851941fc5f8.mp4?t=1788699429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a bowler, you're a bowler, we're BOWLERS!</p>",
